Service
\f1\b0 : We exposed it as a 
\f4 LoadBalancer
\f1 , triggering AWS to spin up an ELB.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0
\f3\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Testing
\f1\b0 : Confirmed the public endpoint serves the NGINX welcome page.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0
\f3\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Scaling
\f1\b0 : Showed how to easily scale up the number of replicas.\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f3\b \cf15 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Cleanup
